---
import Base from '../layouts/Base.astro';
import PageHead from '../components/site/PageHead.astro';
import CupArt from '../components/shop/CupArt.astro';
import { defaultFlavour } from '../content/facts';
---

<Base title="Our story · No Biggie" description="It started as a fix for a bad snack. So we made the cookie smaller and put the dip right in the lid.">
  <PageHead kicker="our story" title="It started as a fix for a bad snack." />
  <article class="wrap story" data-bar-trigger>
    <div class="body">
      <p>
        Every cookie sold in a bag has the same problem. It is too big to dip, too dry to eat on its own, and it arrives without the one
        thing that would make it better: something to dunk it in.
      </p>
      <p class="pull">So we made the cookie smaller and put the dip right in the lid.</p>
      <p>
        The format came first. A clear cup so you can see exactly what you are getting. A dome on top holding the dip, sealed, so it
        travels without a second container. And cookies baked at a size that actually survives being pushed into something thick.
      </p>
      <p>
        Then came the dips. Red velvet needed white chocolate, because the cocoa in a red velvet is mild and wants the sweetness beside
        it. Both chocolate cups landed on Nutella. Hazelnut is the one thing that stands up to that much cocoa without competing with
        it, and it needs no explaining to anybody.
      </p>
      <p>
        Everything is baked to order and goes out the same day. That is the part we are least willing to compromise on, and the reason
        we cannot ship nationwide yet.
      </p>
      <p class="sign hand">— No Biggie, Bangalore</p>
    </div>
    <div class="side" aria-hidden="true">
      <div class="side-art"><CupArt flavour={defaultFlavour} /></div>
    </div>
  </article>
</Base>

<style>
  .story {
    display: grid;
    gap: var(--s-7);
    padding-bottom: var(--section);
  }
  .body {
    display: grid;
    gap: 1.1em;
    font-size: 1.12rem;
    line-height: 1.65;
    max-width: 38rem;
  }
  .pull {
    font-family: var(--f-display);
    font-style: italic;
    font-weight: 600;
    font-size: clamp(1.7rem, 1.3rem + 1.6vw, 2.4rem);
    line-height: 1.15;
    color: var(--velvet);
    margin-block: 0.4em;
  }
  .sign {
    margin-top: 0.6em;
  }
  .side-art {
    aspect-ratio: 1 / 1;
    max-width: 380px;
    margin-inline: auto;
    border-radius: 18px;
    background: radial-gradient(110% 80% at 50% 20%, #FBF5EA 0%, var(--cream-2) 75%);
    box-shadow: var(--shadow-2);
    transform: rotate(2deg);
  }
  @media (min-width: 900px) {
    .story {
      grid-template-columns: 1.3fr 1fr;
      align-items: start;
    }
    .side {
      position: sticky;
      top: 120px;
    }
  }
</style>
